{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biopython/biopython/pulls/5382","id":4906995774,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAAJP9c8AAAABJHrQPg","html_url":"https://github.com/biopython/biopython/pull/5382","diff_url":"https://github.com/biopython/biopython/pull/5382.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/biopython/biopython/pull/5382.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biopython/biopython/issues/5382","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biopython/biopython/pulls/5382/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biopython/biopython/pulls/5382/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biopython/biopython/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biopython/biopython/issues/5382/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biopython/biopython/statuses/f459dd33f2d8f596618c077e8133823626a61bc1","number":5382,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Remove the \"importing Biopython from inside the source tree\" warning","user":{"login":"Oblivionis028","id":96067691,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbngaw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96067691?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblivionis028","html_url":"https://github.com/Oblivionis028","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblivionis028/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblivionis028/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblivionis028/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblivionis028/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblivionis028/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblivionis028/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblivionis028/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblivionis028/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblivionis028/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- [X] I hereby agree to dual licence this and any previous contributions under both\r\nthe _Biopython License Agreement_ **AND** the _BSD 3-Clause License_.\r\n\r\n- [X] I have read the ``CONTRIBUTING.rst`` file, have run ``pre-commit``\r\nlocally, and understand that continuous integration checks will be used to\r\nconfirm the Biopython unit tests and style checks pass with these changes.\r\n\r\n- [x] I have added my name to the alphabetical contributors listings in the files\r\n``NEWS.rst`` and ``CONTRIB.rst`` as part of this pull request, am listed\r\nalready, or do not wish to be listed. (*This acknowledgement is optional.*)\r\n\r\nCloses #5294.\r\n\r\n### What this does\r\n\r\nRemoves the \"You may be importing Biopython from inside the source tree.\"\r\n`BiopythonWarning` that was emitted at import time, together with the now\r\nunused `import os` / `import warnings` and the `_parent_dir` detection block.\r\nAll exception classes (`BiopythonWarning`, `BiopythonExperimentalWarning`,\r\n`BiopythonParserWarning`, `BiopythonDeprecationWarning`, ...) are unchanged.\r\n\r\n### Why the warning fires\r\n\r\nThe check decided \"am I running from the source tree?\" by testing for a\r\n`pyproject.toml` next to the `Bio` package directory, and then confirming\r\ndevelopment mode by looking for a `biopython.egg-link` in `site-packages`.\r\n\r\nThat second step no longer matches reality: modern `pip install -e .`\r\n(PEP 660) writes an `__editable__.biopython-*.pth` file plus an\r\n`__editable___biopython_*_finder.py`, and no `biopython.egg-link`. Therefore\r\n`_dev_mode` is always `False`, and any `pyproject.toml` sitting one level above\r\nthe importable `Bio` package triggers the warning on *every* import - whether\r\nor not the user is actually inside the source tree.\r\n\r\n### Reproduction\r\n\r\n```python\r\n# no editable install involved, just a pyproject.toml next to the package:\r\n#   tmp/Bio/__init__.py  +  tmp/pyproject.toml  on sys.path\r\nPYTHONPATH=tmp python -c \"import Bio\"\r\n# Bio/__init__.py:138: BiopythonWarning: You may be importing Biopython\r\n# from inside the source tree. ... you have a pyproject.toml file in an\r\n# unexpected directory: tmp\r\n```\r\n\r\nWith this change the same command prints nothing.\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\n\r\nFull local suite on Windows / CPython 3.12.15:\r\n\r\n```\r\nRan 515 tests in 87.899 seconds\r\n```\r\n\r\n0 failures, 0 errors (61 modules skipped: optional dependencies such as\r\n`reportlab` and `PAML`, BioSQL without a `biosql.ini`, and online tests via\r\n`--offline`). `Bio.codonalign` still raises its own\r\n`BiopythonExperimentalWarning` as before.\r\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-18T06:38:24Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T19:44:09Z","closed_at":"2026-10-19T19:44:09Z","merged_at":"2026-10-19T19:44:09Z","merge_commit_sha":"f68b896031088a8ad11ae49f5e903d49228fd61f","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Oblivionis028:fix-5294-source-tree-warning","ref":"fix-5294-source-tree-warning","repo":{"id":1401038716,"node_id":"R_kgDOU4InfA","name":"biopython","full_name":"Oblivionis028/biopython","owner":{"login":"Oblivionis028","id":96067691,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbngaw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96067691?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblivionis028","html_url":"https://github.com/Oblivionis028","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblivionis028/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblivionis028/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblivionis028/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblivionis028/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblivionis028/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblivionis028/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblivionis028/repos","events_url":"https://api.gith